  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "みる　ひとに　よっては\nきちょう　かもしれない\nでも　ふつうの　いし。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "보는 사람에 따라서는\n귀중할지도 모르는\n평범한 돌.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在某些人眼裡\n可能會覺得它十分貴重。\n但其實是塊普通的石頭。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une pierre assez banale qui pourrait avoir\nde la valeur pour certains.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Stein, der für manche vielleicht wertvoll\naussieht, tatsächlich aber nur ein gewöhnlicher\nStein ist.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una piedra de aspecto normal que a algunos les\npuede parecer de gran valor.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un sasso qualsiasi che qualcuno potrebbe\nritenere di valore.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A perfectly normal stone that might appear to be\nvaluable to some. It’s all in the eye of the beholder.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "みる　人に　よっては\n貴重　かもしれない\nでも　普通の　石。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在有些人看来\n可能会觉得它十分贵重。\n但其实是块普通的石头。",
